\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces EqLM diagnostic arc from smoke to 11M scale. Smoke-scale pipeline (F10) achieves parity after initialization fix (5.94 vs 5.99 CE loss). Full 11M-parameter runs (F13-F18) show iteration-by-iteration improvement: v1 residual (0.571 BLiMP) $\to $ v3 post-LN (0.704) $\to $ three-seed verdict (0.664 mean, ratio 0.93). Solver-aware loss (F16) teaches contraction with minimal CE cost. Numbers represent 20k-step full-stream BLiMP runs at matched parameters.}}{23}{figure.caption.22}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:eqlm_loss_curves}{{7}{23}{EqLM diagnostic arc from smoke to 11M scale. Smoke-scale pipeline (F10) achieves parity after initialization fix (5.94 vs 5.99 CE loss). Full 11M-parameter runs (F13-F18) show iteration-by-iteration improvement: v1 residual (0.571 BLiMP) $\to $ v3 post-LN (0.704) $\to $ three-seed verdict (0.664 mean, ratio 0.93). Solver-aware loss (F16) teaches contraction with minimal CE cost. Numbers represent 20k-step full-stream BLiMP runs at matched parameters}{figure.caption.22}{}}
